{"version":1,"key":"card:68","content":{"id":68,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"38016c3a-d1ed-4354-955f-709af4e6aee4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Linux Shell 最多可以有 9 个文件描述符，其他 6 个 3~9 可用于重定向，可将其任一个分配给文件。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"5b19f9ed-27e8-4fc0-9e53-6d2bcb2967dd","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"99be07b6-46c8-452f-a773-4be7e139b314","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"# 创建输出重定向\nexec 3> out\necho \"Hello World.\" >&3\necho \"Hi.\" >&3 ","collabId":"7c483219-04aa-4582-a95a-5e52b65316a8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"a0ab818a-24eb-490a-86cd-70a5c42d987f","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"2c6eaca1-6c26-4a9a-b3ca-89acdd72d332","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"# 追加\nexec 3>> out\necho \"Hello World.\" >&3\necho \"Hi.\" >&3 ","collabId":"b8e56bd8-0862-4f8d-b3e1-634101021efc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"26723089-30c0-416d-bdd3-79b3317f4e70","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"重定向文件描述符，然后恢复"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"4f59d3d3-d1e0-45ab-8a0b-4f2b9d19882c","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"019a30a8-1103-4999-a314-b8a1fb52f03d","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"# 3 -> 1 -> stdo\nexec 3>&1\n# 会输出到标准输出\necho \"Hello World.\" >&3\n# 1 -> output\nexec 1> output\n# Hi. 会被输出到 \necho \"Hi.\"\n# 1 -> 3 -> stdo，恢复 1 到标准输出\nexec 1>&3","collabId":"347027c8-9f12-4b41-9351-d2c46ffb988d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fab8a2fc-aab4-4690-8df8-9aab30919946","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"创建输入文件描述符"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"f533fe2f-04c3-4995-b8a4-941697b0c6e8","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"1ecc2a8d-315a-4332-9722-e9fcbbb53820","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"# 6 <- 0，以便后续恢复\nexec 6<&0\nexec 0< names\n\nwhile read name:\ndo\n\techo \"Hello, $name.\"\ndone\n\n# 恢复\nexec 0<&6","collabId":"b9d6cd98-4031-4caa-bf9e-6b88341e0a32","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"b970de1a-c70f-4f3f-8250-1b5fae6d87ef","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"b620dfc3-9b4e-4676-9af0-660e94a845fd","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"xt in ~/shell/redir λ cat names\nAlice\nBob\nCandy\n\nxt in ~/shell/redir λ ./05.sh\nHello, Alice.\nHello, Bob.\nHello, Candy.","collabId":"ef2f781e-fa1d-4951-ad27-8f9506431626","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3c7207c8-4fcd-4738-aaa3-873584ea63a7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"创建读写文件描述符，文件描述符可以同时指向输出和输入"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"071490ce-908c-4447-bc16-07fc13a73ca4","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"2505fb64-5a74-4a7a-b254-cee096bc29c7","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"#!/bin/zsh\n\nexec 3<> names\n\n# 读第一行，并打印\nread name <&3\necho \"$name.\"\n\n# 向第二行起始写入,覆盖原内容\n# Bob -> ddb，前两个字符 Bo 被 dd 覆盖\necho \"dd\" >&3","collabId":"6bb4e1b6-5ec7-412e-b728-336ef4d85fd9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"fa38df02-2c57-4832-b78f-02d61543531e","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"eb3dda72-b6d4-4e8a-8b89-f304e0cd78af","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"xt in ~/shell/redir λ ./06.sh\nAlice.\nxt in ~/shell/redir λ cat names\nAlice\nddb\nCandy","collabId":"843f3178-2faf-4110-b0d1-860846c44a74","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b65b9927-ec68-4cdb-85ee-06ababd0422e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"关闭描述符"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"bfa65f34-d427-4909-af1c-d58290d77f80","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"eb73c693-6e33-4e27-a92c-b63de321f7c4","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"exec 3>&-","collabId":"6b97b948-ae84-4135-87f4-953f0c329367","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"29ddc0bc-234a-45ed-903d-f8739be58da4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"关闭之后，不能继续使用，否则会出现 Bad file descriptor。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6175c5db-75dc-4ed8-b85b-482dcccc35d6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果关闭之后又打开，会用一个新的文件替换已有文件，原文件会被覆盖"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"152c2846-7104-4817-92ba-7cfb9eac36e3","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bf